# Data Cleaning Project

## Project Overview
This project focuses on cleaning raw data and preparing it for analysis. Data cleaning helps improve data quality by handling missing values, duplicate records, and inconsistent data.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy

## Steps Performed
- Data loading
- Checking missing values
- Handling null values
- Removing duplicate data
- Data formatting and transformation
- Preparing clean dataset for analysis

## Conclusion
The cleaned dataset is ready for further analysis and machine learning applications.
